                "prompt": "## 任务：轮询 DGP 模拟（已重启）直到完成并收集结果\n\n### 状态\nDGP 模拟已重启，新 PID=435321，修复了 CmdStanPy 临时文件清理问题。可能从头开始跑 400 runs，也可能从之前的断点继续。\n\n### 操作\nSSH 到 westd-29999（ssh_read_only）\n\n1. **立即检查**：\n```bash\nps -p 435321 -o pid,etime= 2>/dev/null && echo \"RUNNING\" || echo \"DONE\"\ntail -10 /root/contamcal-irt-calibration/logs/threshold_dgp.log\nls -la /root/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/threshold_dgp/\n```\n\n2. **轮询**：每 10 分钟检查一次进度和 PID 存活。**你有很多时间，不要着急退出。**\n```bash\nps -p 435321 -o pid= 2>/dev/null && echo \"RUNNING\" || echo \"DONE\"; tail -3 /root/contamcal-irt-calibration/logs/threshold_dgp.log\n```\n\n3. **完成后**（进程退出或 400/400）：\n   读取结果并做完整分析。结果可能在：\n   - `/root/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/threshold_dgp/*.csv`\n   - `/root/contamcal-irt-calibration/logs/threshold_dgp.log` 末尾\n\n   分析脚本（ssh_execute）：\n   ```bash\n   source /root/miniconda3/etc/profile.d/conda.sh && conda activate base\n   python3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport pandas as pd, numpy as np, json, glob\n\nfiles = glob.glob('/root/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/threshold_dgp/*results*.csv')\nif not files:\n    files = glob.glob('/root/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/threshold_dgp/*.csv')\nif not files:\n    print(\"No CSV found, parsing log...\")\n    import re\n    rows = []\n    with open('/root/contamcal-irt-calibration/logs/threshold_dgp.log') as f:\n        for line in f:\n            if line.strip() and line[0].isdigit():\n                rows.append(line.strip().split(','))\n    print(f\"Parsed {len(rows)} rows\")\n    exit()\n\ndf = pd.read_csv(files[0])\nprint(f\"File: {files[0]}\")\nprint(f\"Shape: {df.shape}\")\nprint(f\"Columns: {list(df.columns)}\")\nprint()\n\n# Find column names\ndgp_col = [c for c in df.columns if 'dgp' in c.lower()][0]\ngamma_true_col = [c for c in df.columns if 'true' in c.lower() and 'gamma' in c.lower()][0] if any('true' in c.lower() and 'gamma' in c.lower() for c in df.columns) else [c for c in df.columns if 'gamma' in c.lower()][0]\ngamma_hat_col = [c for c in df.columns if ('hat' in c.lower() or 'est' in c.lower()) and 'gamma' in c.lower()][0] if any(('hat' in c.lower() or 'est' in c.lower()) and 'gamma' in c.lower() for c in df.columns) else [c for c in df.columns if 'gamma' in c.lower()][1]\n\nprint(f\"Using: dgp={dgp_col}, true={gamma_true_col}, hat={gamma_hat_col}\")\n\nfor dgp in sorted(df[dgp_col].unique()):\n    sub = df[df[dgp_col] == dgp].copy()\n    nz = sub[sub[gamma_true_col] != 0].copy()\n    nz['att'] = nz[gamma_hat_col] / nz[gamma_true_col]\n    nz['bias'] = nz[gamma_hat_col] - nz[gamma_true_col]\n    \n    print(f\"\\n{'='*50}\")\n    print(f\"DGP: {dgp} | N={len(nz)} non-zero-γ runs\")\n    print(f\"  Attenuation (γ̂/γ_true): {nz.att.mean():.4f} ± {nz.att.std():.4f}\")\n    print(f\"  Median: {nz.att.median():.4f}\")\n    print(f\"  Bias (γ̂−γ_true): {nz.bias.mean():.4f} ± {nz.bias.std():.4f}\")\n    \n    ci_lo = [c for c in df.columns if 'lo' in c.lower() or ('ci' in c.lower() and '2.5' in c)]\n    ci_hi = [c for c in df.columns if 'hi' in c.lower() or 'up' in c.lower() or ('ci' in c.lower() and '97.5' in c)]\n    if ci_lo and ci_hi:\n        cov = ((nz[ci_lo[0]] <= nz[gamma_true_col]) & (nz[gamma_true_col] <= nz[ci_hi[0]])).mean()\n        print(f\"  CI coverage: {cov:.1%}\")\n    \n    j_col = [c for c in df.columns if c.upper() == 'J' or 'item' in c.lower()]\n    if j_col:\n        print(f\"\\n  Per-condition:\")\n        for (j, gt), g in nz.groupby([j_col[0], gamma_true_col]):\n            a = g['att']\n            line = f\"    J={j}, γ={gt}: att={a.mean():.3f}±{a.std():.3f}, bias={g.bias.mean():.3f}\"\n            if ci_lo and ci_hi:\n                c = ((g[ci_lo[0]] <= g[gamma_true_col]) & (g[gamma_true_col] <= g[ci_hi[0]])).mean()\n                line += f\", cov={c:.0%}\"\n            print(line)\n\nprint(f\"\\n{'='*50}\")\nprint(\"COMPARISON:\")\nfor dgp in sorted(df[dgp_col].unique()):\n    nz = df[(df[dgp_col] == dgp) & (df[gamma_true_col] != 0)].copy()\n    nz['att'] = nz[gamma_hat_col] / nz[gamma_true_col]\n    print(f\"  {dgp}: mean_att={nz.att.mean():.4f}, median_att={nz.att.median():.4f}\")\nPYEOF\n   ```\n\n4. **注册 artifact**（如果尚未注册）\n\n### 输出\n完整的 R3-W10 结果报告，必须包含 linear vs threshold DGP 对比。"
